            <h1 class="article-title">Inside a regulated fintech's Agentic SecOps penetration test</h1>
            <p class="article-summary">
                How we combined machine-speed coverage with human judgment to assess live payment infrastructure, expose material risk quickly, and give a regulated fintech a practical path to remediation.
            </p>
